                        "review": "This game is perfect for anyone who remembers playing arcade top down shooters.\nthere is a character system in this game so each character gives different perks which is cool because it makes you want to try and beat the game with different characters as each play differently, and it also looks like they have left room for more characters to come.  Gameplay is smooth and enjoyable no crazy bugs that make it unplayable, and the gun upgrade feel like upgrades!   \n\n\nOverall I am having fun with it!",
